# Her club as its own variable: a girl who joined your Koikatsu Club talks of her old club in the past and of the
# Koikatsu Club in the present. Slots from Conversation.ClubCtx: {clubid} swim, manga, tea_ceremony, track_field, cheerleading, none; {kclub}
# yes when she joined your Koikatsu Club; then {club} is "Koikatsu Club", {oldclub}/{oldclubid} the club she left
# ({hadclub} yes/no), {kmate} another member (a friend first), {kmates} none/some/many.
# Every rule here has three conditions or more, so the plain "subject=club" lines (one) never play over them.

# ================= the player's openers =================

@rule me.small.kclub
on me.small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher
- [How are you finding the club?|Is the club treating you okay?|Settling into the club?]
- [Anything you want to do at the club this week?|Got ideas for the next club activity?]
- [Do you miss your old club at all?|Was it hard to switch to our club?]

@rule me.small.club.own
on me.small
when subject=club kclub=no role!=teacher
- [How's the {club} going?|Busy at the {club}?|What's new at the {club}?]
- [Anything happening at the {club} lately?|How are things at the {club}?] [You never tell me about it.|I'm curious.]
- [Still busy with the {club}?|The {club} keeping you busy?]

# ================= in your Koikatsu Club: the present =================

@rule small.kclub.reports~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher kmates=some|many
shape state
hook kclub_reports
opens thank,ask,tease
- {kmate} helped me with the club reports yesterday. I owe her one.
- {kmate} and I finished the activity report together. It's actually readable this time.
- {kmate} keeps fixing my handwriting on the reports. It's embarrassing.
- I did the weekly report with {kmate}. We argued about every single line. Hehe.

@rule me.h.kclub_reports
on me.small
when hook=kclub_reports
- How are the club reports coming along?
- Did the report get done?

@rule move.h.kclub_reports.thank
on move.thank
when hook=kclub_reports
- Thank her for keeping up with the reports

@rule react.h.kclub_reports.thank
on react
when hook=kclub_reports move=thank fit=good|neutral
- It's my club too now. I want it to look good.
- Hehe. Tell {kmate} too, she did half.
- Someone has to. You'd write 'we had fun' and call it done.

@rule move.h.kclub_reports.ask
on move.ask
when hook=kclub_reports
- Ask how {kmate} is doing

@rule react.h.kclub_reports.ask
on react
when hook=kclub_reports move=ask fit=good|neutral
- She's great. Strict about deadlines, though.
- Busy, but she always makes time for the club.
- Good! She asked about you, actually.

@rule move.h.kclub_reports.tease
on move.tease
when hook=kclub_reports
- Tease her about needing help

@rule react.h.kclub_reports.tease
on react
when hook=kclub_reports move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Hey! I did my half! ...Mostly.
- Everyone needs help with paperwork. Everyone.
- Says the one who never writes them.

@rule react.h.kclub_reports.bad
on react
when hook=kclub_reports fit=bad
feel pout
- You could help too, you know.
- Don't make fun of it. It's work.

@rule small.kclub.help~q
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher
shape q
hook kclub_help
opens agree,ask,tease
- Can you help me with the club activity today? I can't set it up alone.
- Hey, could you give me a hand with the club activity? Just for a bit.
- I need help with this week's club activity. You're the president, so... please?
- Will you help me plan the next club activity? I have ideas, but they're a mess.

@rule me.h.kclub_help
on me.small
when hook=kclub_help
- Need anything for the club?
- Want help with the club activity?

@rule move.h.kclub_help.agree
on move.agree
when hook=kclub_help
- Say you'll help with the activity

@rule react.h.kclub_help.agree
on react
when hook=kclub_help move=agree fit=good|neutral
- Really? Thanks! I'll save you the easy part.
- Yay. With two of us it'll go twice as fast.
- I knew I could count on you. Club room after class?

@rule move.h.kclub_help.ask
on move.ask
when hook=kclub_help
- Ask what the activity is

@rule react.h.kclub_help.ask
on react
when hook=kclub_help move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It's a surprise. Mostly because I haven't decided.
- Something fun. With snacks. Details later.
- We're redoing the whiteboard and the schedule. Exciting, right?

@rule move.h.kclub_help.tease
on move.tease
when hook=kclub_help
- Tease her for asking the president

@rule react.h.kclub_help.tease
on react
when hook=kclub_help move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Who else would I ask? You're the reason the club exists.
- You started this club. You take responsibility.
- I'm asking nicely, aren't I?

@rule react.h.kclub_help.bad
on react
when hook=kclub_help fit=bad
feel pout
- Forget it. I'll do it myself.
- Fine. I didn't need you anyway.

@rule small.kclub.room~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher
shape state
hook kclub_room
opens ask,share,invite
- The club room feels different now that I come here every day. Cozier.
- I brought a cushion to the club room. Don't tell anyone it's mine.
- I like our club time. It's the quietest hour of my day.
- Somebody wrote something silly on the club whiteboard again. It wasn't me.

@rule me.h.kclub_room
on me.small
when hook=kclub_room
- What do you think of the club room?
- Getting used to club time?

@rule move.h.kclub_room.ask
on move.ask
when hook=kclub_room
- Ask what she likes about club time

@rule react.h.kclub_room.ask
on react
when hook=kclub_room move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nobody expects anything from me there. Except you.
- The people. And the snacks.
- It feels like our own little place.

@rule move.h.kclub_room.share
on move.share
when hook=kclub_room
- Say club time is your favorite part too

@rule react.h.kclub_room.share
on react
when hook=kclub_room move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then we agree. Good.
- Hehe. Don't get sappy on me.
- I had a feeling you'd say that.

@rule move.h.kclub_room.invite
on move.invite
when hook=kclub_room
- Ask her to stay after club time

@rule react.h.kclub_room.invite
on react
when hook=kclub_room move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Just for a bit? Okay.
- Sure. The room's nice when it's empty.
- If you're offering... yes.

@rule react.h.kclub_room.bad
on react
when hook=kclub_room fit=bad
feel pout
- It's just a room.
- Don't make it weird.

@rule small.kclub.alone~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher kmates=none
shape state
hook kclub_alone
opens comfort,praise,invite
- It's just us in the club for now. I don't mind. Really.
- We need more members. But I kind of like it being only the two of us.

@rule me.h.kclub_alone
on me.small
when hook=kclub_alone
- Do you mind that it's a small club?
- Should we look for more members?

@rule move.h.kclub_alone.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=kclub_alone
- Say more people will join soon

@rule react.h.kclub_alone.comfort
on react
when hook=kclub_alone move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I hope so. But don't rush it.
- Okay. I trust your eye for people.
- Just not anyone annoying.

@rule move.h.kclub_alone.praise
on move.praise
when hook=kclub_alone
- Say she makes the club worth it

@rule react.h.kclub_alone.praise
on react
when hook=kclub_alone move=praise fit=good|neutral
- W-what? Don't say things like that so easily.
- ...Thanks. I'll keep showing up, then.
- You're such a flatterer.

@rule move.h.kclub_alone.invite
on move.invite
when hook=kclub_alone
- Ask her to help find new members

@rule react.h.kclub_alone.invite
on react
when hook=kclub_alone move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure. I'll put up posters.
- I'll ask around. Discreetly.
- Okay! Recruitment mission.

@rule react.h.kclub_alone.bad
on react
when hook=kclub_alone fit=bad
feel pout
- You're not taking it seriously.
- Whatever.

# ================= in your Koikatsu Club: the club she left, in the past =================

@rule small.kclub.old~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher hadclub=yes
shape state
hook kclub_old
opens ask,comfort,praise
- I used to be in the {oldclub}. Feels like a long time ago now.
- Back when I was in the {oldclub}, I never had a free afternoon.
- Some of the {oldclub} girls still wave at me in the hallway. That's nice.
- I don't regret leaving the {oldclub}. I just think about it sometimes.

@rule small.kclub.old.swim~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher hadclub=yes oldclubid=swim
shape state
hook kclub_old
opens ask,comfort,praise
- I swam every afternoon in the swim club. My hair smelled like chlorine for a year.
- I still dream about the pool sometimes. Old swim club habits.

@rule small.kclub.old.manga~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher hadclub=yes oldclubid=manga
shape state
hook kclub_old
opens ask,comfort,praise
- In the manga club I drew the same page for a month. I never finished it.
- I left my sketchbook in the manga club room when I quit. I should get it back.

@rule small.kclub.old.tea_ceremony~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher hadclub=yes oldclubid=tea_ceremony
shape state
hook kclub_old
opens ask,comfort,praise
- When I was in the tea ceremony club, I could sit still for an hour. Now look at me.
- I learned to whisk tea properly in the tea ceremony club. I can still do it.

@rule small.kclub.old.track_field~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher hadclub=yes oldclubid=track_field
shape state
hook kclub_old
opens ask,comfort,praise
- I used to run laps after school with the track team. My legs still remember.
- Back in track and field, I had a best time I was proud of. I wonder if I could still beat it.

@rule small.kclub.old.cheerleading~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=yes role!=teacher hadclub=yes oldclubid=cheerleading
shape state
hook kclub_old
opens ask,comfort,praise
- I was a cheerleader before I joined our club. I still know all the routines.
- In the cheer club I was always at the front. It was loud. I loved it.

@rule me.h.kclub_old
on me.small
when hook=kclub_old
- Do you miss your old club?
- What was your old club like?

@rule move.h.kclub_old.ask
on move.ask
when hook=kclub_old
- Ask why she left her old club

@rule react.h.kclub_old.ask
on react
when hook=kclub_old move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I wanted something different. And someone asked me.
- It stopped being fun. This is fun.
- You asked me to join yours. Simple as that.

@rule move.h.kclub_old.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=kclub_old
- Say she can still visit them

@rule react.h.kclub_old.comfort
on react
when hook=kclub_old move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Yeah. Maybe I will. Sometime.
- They'd like that, I think.
- Thanks. It's not like I hate them or anything.

@rule move.h.kclub_old.praise
on move.praise
when hook=kclub_old
- Say she must have been good at it

@rule react.h.kclub_old.praise
on react
when hook=kclub_old move=praise fit=good|neutral
- I was okay. Better than okay, sometimes.
- Hehe. I'll take that.
- You never saw me, so you can't know. But thanks.

@rule react.h.kclub_old.bad
on react
when hook=kclub_old fit=bad
feel pout
- Let's not talk about it.
- That's in the past.

# ================= her own club, in the present (not in yours) =================

@rule small.club.swim~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=no role!=teacher clubid=swim
shape state
hook club_swim
opens ask,praise,invite
- Swim practice ran long again. I can still feel the water in my ears.
- Our coach wants us to shave half a second off. Half a second!
- The pool's freezing in the mornings. We swim anyway.

@rule me.h.club_swim
on me.small
when hook=club_swim
- How's practice at the {club}?
- Busy at the {club} today?

@rule move.h.club_swim.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_swim
- Ask what her best stroke is

@rule react.h.club_swim.ask
on react
when hook=club_swim move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Freestyle. But don't tell the coach I hate backstroke.
- Butterfly, when I'm not tired.
- Breaststroke. It's relaxing.

@rule move.h.club_swim.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_swim
- Say she must be fast in the water

@rule react.h.club_swim.praise
on react
when hook=club_swim move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Faster than you, probably. Hehe.
- Some days. Others I'm a rock.
- Come time me sometime.

@rule move.h.club_swim.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_swim
- Ask if you can watch a practice

@rule react.h.club_swim.invite
on react
when hook=club_swim move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Sure, but don't stare.
- Only from the stands!
- If you bring a towel.

@rule react.h.club_swim.bad
on react
when hook=club_swim fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't really care.
- Never mind.

@rule small.club.manga~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=no role!=teacher clubid=manga
shape state
hook club_manga
opens ask,praise,tease
- We're making a short comic for the festival. My panels are the worst ones.
- The manga club argued about inking for an hour today.
- I finally finished a page. One page. It took all week.

@rule me.h.club_manga
on me.small
when hook=club_manga
- How's practice at the {club}?
- Busy at the {club} today?

@rule move.h.club_manga.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_manga
- Ask what her comic is about

@rule react.h.club_manga.ask
on react
when hook=club_manga move=ask fit=good|neutral
- It's a secret. ...It's a romance.
- A girl who fights robots after school.
- Promise not to laugh? It's about a cat detective.

@rule move.h.club_manga.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_manga
- Say you'd love to read it

@rule react.h.club_manga.praise
on react
when hook=club_manga move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Really? Don't say that unless you mean it.
- Okay... maybe when it's done.
- Then I have to finish it now.

@rule move.h.club_manga.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_manga
- Tease her about drawing you

@rule react.h.club_manga.tease
on react
when hook=club_manga move=tease fit=good|neutral
- As if! ...Maybe as a background character.
- You'd be the villain. Obviously.
- Don't give me ideas.

@rule react.h.club_manga.bad
on react
when hook=club_manga fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't really care.
- Never mind.

@rule small.club.tea_ceremony~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=no role!=teacher clubid=tea_ceremony
shape state
hook club_tea
opens ask,praise,invite
- We practiced the tea ceremony today. I finally didn't spill.
- The tea ceremony club has a guest day soon. I'm nervous.
- My legs fell asleep during practice again.

@rule me.h.club_tea
on me.small
when hook=club_tea
- How's practice at the {club}?
- Busy at the {club} today?

@rule move.h.club_tea.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_tea
- Ask what the hardest part is

@rule react.h.club_tea.ask
on react
when hook=club_tea move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sitting still. And smiling while my legs scream.
- The order of everything. There's so much.
- Not spilling. Honestly.

@rule move.h.club_tea.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_tea
- Say it sounds elegant

@rule react.h.club_tea.praise
on react
when hook=club_tea move=praise fit=good|neutral
- It looks elegant. It feels like a test.
- Thank you. I try.
- You should come taste it.

@rule move.h.club_tea.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_tea
- Ask her to make you tea sometime

@rule react.h.club_tea.invite
on react
when hook=club_tea move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Properly? That takes a while. ...Okay.
- If you sit through the whole thing.
- Sure. Bring sweets.

@rule react.h.club_tea.bad
on react
when hook=club_tea fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't really care.
- Never mind.

@rule small.club.track_field~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=no role!=teacher clubid=track_field
shape state
hook club_track
opens ask,praise,invite
- We ran intervals today. I can't feel my legs.
- Track meet's coming up. I want a new best time.
- The coach made us run the stairs. All of them.

@rule me.h.club_track
on me.small
when hook=club_track
- How's practice at the {club}?
- Busy at the {club} today?

@rule move.h.club_track.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_track
- Ask what event she runs

@rule react.h.club_track.ask
on react
when hook=club_track move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The 400. It's the worst and I love it.
- Sprints. Short and painful.
- Long distance. I like the quiet.

@rule move.h.club_track.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_track
- Say you've seen her train hard

@rule react.h.club_track.praise
on react
when hook=club_track move=praise fit=good|neutral
- You were watching? Ugh, I looked awful.
- Thanks. It'll pay off at the meet.
- Then you know I'm not lazy.

@rule move.h.club_track.invite
on move.invite
when hook=club_track
- Offer to cheer at the meet

@rule react.h.club_track.invite
on react
when hook=club_track move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? Then I can't lose.
- Sit where I can see you.
- Don't be too loud. ...Okay, be loud.

@rule react.h.club_track.bad
on react
when hook=club_track fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't really care.
- Never mind.

@rule small.club.cheerleading~state
on small
when subject=club kclub=no role!=teacher clubid=cheerleading
shape state
hook club_cheer
opens ask,praise,tease
- We learned a new routine. I almost dropped someone. Almost.
- The cheer squad's practicing for the next game. My voice is gone.
- Our captain wants more jumps. My knees disagree.

@rule me.h.club_cheer
on me.small
when hook=club_cheer
- How's practice at the {club}?
- Busy at the {club} today?

@rule move.h.club_cheer.ask
on move.ask
when hook=club_cheer
- Ask who they're cheering for next

@rule react.h.club_cheer.ask
on react
when hook=club_cheer move=ask fit=good|neutral
- The basketball team. They need all the help.
- Whoever's losing, honestly.
- The track meet. Big crowd.

@rule move.h.club_cheer.praise
on move.praise
when hook=club_cheer
- Say she must be great on the field

@rule react.h.club_cheer.praise
on react
when hook=club_cheer move=praise fit=good|neutral
- I'm the loudest. That counts, right?
- Come see and tell me.
- Hehe. Thanks!

@rule move.h.club_cheer.tease
on move.tease
when hook=club_cheer
- Ask her to cheer just for you

@rule react.h.club_cheer.tease
on react
when hook=club_cheer move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Only if you win something.
- Go, go... no. Too embarrassing.
- That costs extra.

@rule react.h.club_cheer.bad
on react
when hook=club_cheer fit=bad
feel pout
- You don't really care.
- Never mind.
